                                                "sense_id": "30fdf998-02d0-37a8-a353-acc8985aa4d3",
                                                "text": "All train movements on the Far North Line have been controlled by a Radio Electronic Token Block workstation at Inverness since 1995, having already been introduced on the Kyle Line some 11 years earlier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
